# Big binaries that must never reach the image.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, and nothing here excluded jars — so building
# from a local working copy silently baked ~103MB of dead ThetaData jars
# (ThetaTerminalv3.jar + lib/*.jar) into the dashboard image. A VPS build from a
# git clone never hit it because they are gitignored, which is exactly why it
# went unnoticed. Theta is gone now and these are dead weight either way.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluding *.csv or eng.traineddata: the OCR data feeds
# /api/tpo-extract and some CSVs under data/ may be read at runtime. Excluding
# either on a guess is how you break a route nobody tests.
*.jar
isolate-*.log
